{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059270/extras/d52668edc6a8d178a653254be800db37.avif?t=1759805377\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pungo is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats, original power-ups, and innovative levels full of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each kitten has its own mix of abilities, unique stats, and distinct playstyles, try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-flop, or kick to charge energy and unleash super moves to dominate the field! Be the fastest kitten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends, organize tournaments, and become the most victorious cat. Scratch mystery boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable world of Pungo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059270?t=1759805377","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059270/d0f55e6fec2fc46475e54cb935f0c25093ad0355/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759805377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059270/b8e8acb82ce3be158d0676b008cfc060ff1b20d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759805377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059270/b8e8acb82ce3be158d0676b008cfc060ff1b20d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759805377","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}